    "created_at": "2017-10-28T04:47:31Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-10-28T04:47:31Z",
    "body": "This has very practical implications.\r\n\r\nIn the above code, would the canvas be showing a 500x500 backing store, or a 800x800? If it is the former, then we might as well resize the incoming imageBitmap to the size of the canvas, since there is no way to get a reference to the imageBitmap again (it's effectively closed on transfer, although the specification doesn't currently call this out explicitly, see #3166).\r\n\r\nI think I prefer the idea that the transfer function changes the size of the canvas backing store, which is then visible as width and height on the canvas.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/340139113/reactions",
