    "created_at": "2017-10-31T15:34:38Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-10-31T15:34:38Z",
    "body": "I think the behavior for this case is already defined in the spec, but perhaps it lacks clarity.\r\nThe intrinsic size of the canvas is given by the dimensions of its bitmap. When using an ImageBitmapRenderingContext, the width and height content attributes of the canvas element only control the intrinsic size when there is no bitmap.  For example, after calling brc.transferFromImageBitmap(null);\r\n\r\nDo you think we need to add a not to the spec, or something like that?",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
